#: ../../reference_manual/sharing_krita_logs.rst:71
msgid ""
"The easiest way to get Krita Usage Log is through Krita's GUI. Go to  :"
"menuselection:`Help --> Show Krita Log for bug reports`. A new dialog will "
"open, showing the content of the log."
msgstr ""
"A maneira mais fácil de obter o registro de uso do Krita é através da "
"interface gráfica do usuário (GUI). Acesse :menuselection:`Ajuda --> Mostrar "
